# Bleed for the vertical parallax (look up 100 px from the room top, look down 150 px; factor 1.6 moves the
# foreground up to 173 px down and 240 px up). `<piece>-foot` (16 tiles) sits under a standing piece, its x 32 px
# left of the piece, its top at the piece bottom: the stems and blades carry straight on down, darkening to near
# black (author, 2026-11-19: no roots or clods, roots are never seen through earth). `<piece>-top` (12 tiles, room
# y -184 to 7) sits over a hanging piece, 32 px left of it: what the piece hangs from, open (limbs, a side branch
# and leaf clusters with sky between them); the piece's own rows 0 to 7, above the steady frame, are empty.
piece tuft-foot 11 16
